From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Yureka Lilian <yureka@cyberchaos.dev>
Date: Fri, 20 Nov 2026 12:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: apple: j773g: Add radios and Ethernet

Describe the Mac mini's on-board Ethernet endpoint on PCIe port 2 and
its bus-number-to-DART mapping. Both on-board endpoints use stream 1 on
this board. Add the Ethernet alias for the bootloader's MAC fixup and
select the sakhalin Wi-Fi and Bluetooth firmware board type.

Include the desktop SMC sensor description rather than laptop sensors.
The shared T8132 description already enables the internal NVMe device.

Based on Gravity Linux commits dc57ab5350c7 (PCIe), a8812ad28833 (radio
power) and the J773g tree at c7e7b86aed0c. Use a zero MAC placeholder and
retain the corrected sakhalin spelling. No notebook properties change.
The original PCIe commit has no author sign-off.

Link: https://github.com/GravityLinux/linux/commit/dc57ab5350c7dabe62a65f716fd1ce49b7cf3cfc
Link: https://github.com/GravityLinux/linux/blob/c7e7b86aed0c4c052851e5c3b2c02088c0602f02/arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/t8132-j773g.dts

Assisted-by: LLM
---
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/t8132-j773g.dts | 34 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 34 insertions(+)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/t8132-j773g.dts b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/t8132-j773g.dts
index ebdd6cc..2466eea 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/t8132-j773g.dts
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/t8132-j773g.dts
@@ -16,6 +16,10 @@
 / {
 	compatible = "apple,j773g", "apple,t8132", "apple,arm-platform";
 	model = "Apple Mac mini (M4, 2024)";
+
+	aliases {
+		ethernet0 = &ethernet0;
+	};
 };
 
 /*
@@ -24,3 +28,33 @@ / {
 &framebuffer0 {
 	power-domains = <&ps_dispext0_fe>, <&ps_dptx_phy>;
 };
+
+&bluetooth0 {
+	brcm,board-type = "apple,sakhalin";
+};
+
+&pcie0 {
+	iommu-map = <0x100 &pcie0_dart 1 1>,
+		    <0x200 &pcie2_dart 1 1>;
+};
+
+&pcie2_dart {
+	status = "okay";
+};
+
+&port02 {
+	bus-range = <2 2>;
+	status = "okay";
+
+	ethernet0: ethernet@0,0 {
+		reg = <0x20000 0x0 0x0 0x0 0x0>;
+		/* Filled in by the bootloader for either Ethernet option. */
+		local-mac-address = [00 00 00 00 00 00];
+	};
+};
+
+&wifi0 {
+	brcm,board-type = "apple,sakhalin";
+};
+
+#include "hwmon-mini.dtsi"
